Methods.Summary:
Sets the multivalue to a string pattern

Args
----
- string_pattern (str): A string pattern

Examples
--------
- Test-{Inc:1,1}
- Test-{"A", "B", "C"}
- hex_{Dec:0xFFFF}
- Test-{Inc:100}-{"A", "B"}-{Dec:3, 1, 3}

